	(text "U7 values follow TI's TPS54202HEVM-716 5 V design (100k / 13.3k with 75 pF across the top\nresistor: 0.596 V x (1 + 100/13.3) = 5.08 V; 15 uH; 500 kHz). R20 enables U7 from the 12 V side.\nD3 blocks a reversed 12 V lead. The load is small: the 3.3 V regulator on VSYS (RP2350, RM2, flash,\nPSRAM) and the four output boards' shifters (VCCB on +5V, VCCA on +3V3), well under 0.5 A.\n+5V feeds the ribbons directly; VSYS gets it through D4 so USB can't back-feed the buck."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "78681bbc-e08f-5553-bc97-a08d7cc6918b")
	)
